OL,3,GNEWSAWater company fined almost #8m for
OL,4,Asewage spills
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has been fined almost
OL,7,F#8m for a series of pollution-related
OL,8,Foffences over six years.
OL,10,FSouth West Water previously entered
OL,11,Fguilty pleas at Plymouth Magistrates'
OL,12,FCourt after an investigation by the
OL,13,FEnvironment Agency into incidents
OL,14,Fbetween 2015 and 2021 in Bodmin,
OL,15,FHarlyn, Playing Place, and Polperro in
OL,16,FCornwall, and Plymouth in Devon.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
